---
const footerNavLinks = [
  { label: 'Karya Editorial', href: '#editorial-portfolio' },
  { label: 'Buku Suara & VO', href: '#voice-audio-reel' },
  { label: 'MC & Panggung', href: '#mc-live-stage' },
  { label: 'Tentang', href: '#about-naulia' }
];
---

<footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-[0_-1px_12px_rgba(28,26,23,0.03)] border-t border-outline-variant/30 pb-20 lg:pb-0">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin py-space-xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg mb-space-xl">
      <!-- Brand & Bio Summary -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
          <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-semibold">
            Naulia Zahra
          </span>
          <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">
            Studio
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Menciptakan perjalanan masa kecil yang berkesan melalui karya editorial, penceritaan suara bernyawa, dan kehadiran panggung yang hangat nan elegan.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs pt-space-xs">
          <a
            aria-label="Kirim Email Studio"
            href="mailto:nauliazahra.studio@gmail.com"
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-2xs"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">
              mail
            </span>
          </a>
          <a
            aria-label="Repertoar Buku Suara"
            href="#voice-audio-reel"
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-2xs"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">
              graphic_eq
            </span>
          </a>
          <a
            aria-label="Panggung Acara"
            href="#mc-live-stage"
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-2xs"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">
              mic
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Navigation -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface font-bold mb-space-xs">
          Navigasi
        </span>
        {footerNavLinks.map((link) => (
          <a
            href={link.href}
            class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors py-1"
          >
            {link.label}
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Agency & Direct Representation Box -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface font-bold mb-space-xs">
          Kontak & Manajemen Agensi
        </span>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Terbuka untuk kolaborasi penyuntingan literatur anak, pengisian suara animasi/audiobook internasional, dan pemanduan panggung festival.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-space-xs p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col gap-1 border border-outline-variant/30">
          <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant font-bold">
            Hubungi Agensi & Studio
          </span>
          <a
            href="mailto:nauliazahra.studio@gmail.com"
            class="font-body-md text-body-md text-primary hover:text-on-primary-container font-semibold transition-colors break-all"
          >
            nauliazahra.studio@gmail.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright & Geographic Strip -->
    <div class="pt-space-md border-t border-surface-container flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-sm">
      <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-center sm:text-left">
        © 2025 Naulia Zahra. Dihadirkan dengan ketelitian editorial & kehangatan cerita.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md">
        <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          Jakarta • Daring & Global
        </span>
        <a href="#contact" class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">
          Tanyakan Ketersediaan
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
